0\u00b0 Live-Streams in 3D - als w\u00e4rst du selbst da \nW\u00e4hle deinen Kamerawinkel jederzeit \n\nRiesige Events in Echtzeit: Bundesliga, Supercup, Festivals u.v.m. \nSprach- und Handsteuerung f\u00fcr maximale Immersion \n  \nBE THERE NOW. ", "short_description": "Sport & Konzerte in 360\u00b0 \u2013 be there now "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "CoverImageSquare.png", "id": "1656216171741820", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819775_1656216175075153_2895559536759162680_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rBHrUOQCXh4Q7kNvwEg-Q6_&_nc_oc=AdpHDlu4HdqItq3k57rc-nIQamumL-h0gHR64r21SY1q26WArAPngrhVmhODiS6YuOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFlpHVkVf0iihiyXIHlFWcR1Gw2rXFa5k8D8AYMviWSYg&oe=6A8AE3D6"}, {"file_name": "CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "1414326893195674", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821107_1414326896529007_8462027792716524313_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BpzSYiK_jVUQ7kNvwG2xClK&_nc_oc=AdoBraxC8dpL3eeSAEWEG4B8-zJKipsfFGeVnplCnBvp3GohneMDiqS72te9oEwECBg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFcS2r1U9BU0-YaN3KXJb3RAKpwfofM66G7gkrrWmHVNA&oe=6A8AEDAD"}, {"file_name": "L1VE_LOGO.png", "id": "1141925937781157", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822789_1141925944447823_7424494728140263932_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jkjfIJp2-d0Q7kNvwHVqa9f&_nc_oc=AdoT8bABnbGf8k9Cn1z0qaqNZGaOxSzqNZdVWw2t9uOIcSvmgSYWSPKt-1f4xH3Hues&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHg1S2mtrPAfDylaG6nIQmgED7CQppAaLSPp7LwJ6lgkQ&oe=6A8AE5ED"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "996045819187461", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820325_996045822520794_3628469034101667116_n.png?_nc_ca